# build context minimization (q-center/q-executor Dockerfile context = project root)
#
# NOTE: keep every pattern ASCII-only.
# BuildKit sends these patterns in a gRPC header and fails with
#   header key "exclude-patterns" contains value with non-printable ASCII characters
# if any entry has non-ASCII characters. Use wildcards for Korean-named
# directories instead (e.g. dataQ*/ for the design-docs folder).
.git/
.idea/
.vscode/
.claude/
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
**/target/classes/
**/target/generated-sources/
**/target/maven-status/
**/target/maven-archiver/
**/target/test-classes/
**/target/site/
dataQ*/
GS*/
docker/dataq-db/pgdata/
docker/dataq-db/initdb/
ndata-quality-*/
*.log
logs/
c:/temp/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
